      type AIDigestWeeklySettingsReader interface {
          AIMode(ctx context.Context) (string, error)
          AIFeatureEnabled(ctx, featureID string) (bool, error)
      }
      type AIDigestWeeklyResult struct { Skipped, Processed int }
      RunAIDigestWeekly(ctx, settings):
        1. Re-read AIMode at run time. Read error → fail-CLOSED (treat as off).
        2. If off → return Result{Skipped:1}.
        3. Re-read AIFeatureEnabled("digest-narration"). Read error → off.
        4. If false → return Result{Skipped:1}.
        5. Otherwise return zeroed Result (fan-out deferred to future slice).
      Per ADR-015 §I12 #3: scheduling-time check is NOT enough; the run-time
      re-check guarantees a flag flipped between schedule and execute is
      honored.

